<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Freight-CF.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Freight-CF.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal said it upgraded Consolidated Freightways Corp - CF Motor Freight to outperform from &quot;outperform speculative.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said raised 1997 earnings estimate to $0.75 a share from $0.60 a share and increased 1998 to $1.25 a share from $1.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- Consolidated Freightways-CF gained 1/8 to 9-3/4.</p>
</text>
